---
import BrandSpark from './BrandSpark.astro';
---
<section class="hero container" id="home" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="availability"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-i18n="availability">Відкритий до нових проєктів</span></div>
          <p class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow" data-i18n="heroEyebrow">НЕЗАЛЕЖНИЙ ВЕБРОЗРОБНИК</p>
          <h1 id="hero-heading"><span data-i18n="heroLine1">Хороші ідеї.</span><br /><span class="highlight" data-i18n="heroLine2">Класні сайти.</span><svg class="hero-spark" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M32 3v58M3 32h58M11.5 11.5l41 41m0-41-41 41" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="8" /></svg></h1>
          <p class="hero-description" data-i18n="heroDescription">Перетворюю вашу ідею на продуманий цифровий досвід. З характером у дизайні. З порядком у коді.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="#work"><span data-i18n="viewWork">Переглянути роботи</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#contact"><span data-i18n="discussProject">Обговорити проєкт</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
          <div class="hero-footnote"><span class="small-cross" aria-hidden="true"><BrandSpark /></span><span data-i18n="heroNote">Від першого «а що, як…» до останнього пікселя.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="art-grid"></div><span class="art-coordinate art-coordinate-top">IDEA → DESIGN → CODE</span>
          <div class="code-window"><div class="window-bar"><span class="window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>something-great.tsx</span><span>⌘</span></div><div class="code-body"><div class="line-numbers">01<br />02<br />03<br />04<br />05<br />06<br />07<br />08<br />09</div><code><span class="code-purple">const</span> yourNextWebsite = &#123;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;design: <span class="code-green">'thoughtful'</span>,<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;experience: <span class="code-green">'effortless'</span>,<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;details: <span class="code-green">'matter'</span>,<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;possibilities: <span class="code-orange">Infinity</span>,<br />&#125;;<br /><br /><span class="code-purple">let's</span> buildSomething(<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="code-green">'extraordinary'</span><br />);</code></div></div>
          <div class="preview-window"><div class="preview-toolbar"><span class="window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>your-next-big-thing.com</span><span>↗</span></div><div class="preview-content"><div class="preview-topline"><b>hello®</b><span>MADE TO MAKE A DIFFERENCE</span></div><div class="preview-title">Good things.<br /><span>Start here.</span></div><div class="asterisk"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="preview-bottom"><span>LET'S MAKE IT HAPPEN</span><span class="preview-arrow">↗</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="art-sticker"><span>↗</span><div data-i18n="artSticker">Ваша ідея.<br />Моя наступна пригода.</div></div><div class="art-caption"><span class="status-dot"></span><span>CRAFTED WITH CARE, BUILT WITH CODE</span></div><span class="art-coordinate art-coordinate-bottom">&lt; / &gt;</span>
        </div>
      </section>
